# Llamadas de prueba a /api/brands (REST Client de VS Code / Cursor).
### Alta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/brands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gloria"
}

### Listado
GET http://localhost:8080/api/brands

### Una marca (cambiar el id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/brands/1

### Editar nombre
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/brands/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Filgo"
}

### Baja lógica
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/brands/1

### Reactivar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/brands/1/activate
